        <div class="iah__l4-column-title" tabindex="-1"> Governance and Responsible Business </div>
        <p>Managing risks and behaviours driven by ethics and integrity are vital to protecting the trust and confidence of our customers, colleagues and wider stakeholders. These responsibilities are shared by everyone at NatWest Group.</p>
			<!--<p>In order to succeed with customers, it&rsquo;s important we behave and act in a way that meets their expectations. We aim to follow high standards of business conduct, helping us to stay compliant with legal and regulatory requirements, and meet the behavioural expectations of our customers and stakeholders.</p>-->
        <p class="hide-devices">&nbsp;</p>
        <a class="iah__l4-column-explore iah__l4-column-cta linktag" href="https://www.natwestgroup.com/sustainability/governance-and-responsible-business.html" data-level="l4" style="z-index: 999;"><span class="iah__l4-blurb">Go to Governance and Responsible Business</span> </a> </li>
